结构性改革，而不是部分改革。”他呼吁立法者明年在他因任期限制离任后重新考虑这个问题。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/QGobrITVPOOWbNCMkKF6mT_3khWZnG2RjGhbUhPS7_rRf31b0NAwjBmvADS-ZWhw_CD48hQgYAe4Cnww_0JwGYq44ympABDtFpSlp8Vht7XEwaR6TW4rbNn5ZasGzNLAWHQtqE-J70lR51riiufLJ3Rv9guf00PR4EKzY3MG_e5UF8wM_awApnm8_9YzFPXTqUc4mdch01722vRIk0d5dUmSrSuwWmCkmoPUzAeO-9HQEpmbm1DOKN3OYkHgMbvRrKHzfW7WUo5e1wKCc8isG2NucQyWb84-njvbJIzSFnU5eBJVMXfPaoNkV_IBKUsKehpWTeuUpciH8flPcY6y0101hW4TTKnWKv-Jr5XkG5bormnMikpipgwsctseCXaRziHTgFBC8Ir0reJ9dmA5v5xPlul__SOixz9pZy1U02uLK1qYgJ-q8KEZ6K_HuNAbc1So32qsWGdl7pn3z23RLymlCQysU6S-xyJ9_kNLiVV9-N0ZgkBukA9WHNFD-5jn1r_2bA8rixfVkvCY-ARbx5pCKwGxSIJdEXBbsfp-aGWow108aNOhC2dj/u4ExLs279Bayi-KPABX-VvqmYNWZdj9O/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e; text-decoration: none !important;" target="_blank" title="加州立法者未经纽瑟姆询问就提交了野火计划"&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; margin: 24px 0 0 0; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; font-size: 14px !important; color: #000 !important; text-decoration: none !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt; 🎥 所有电影人注意了！&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;正在制作一部有关气候变化的短片？不要错过将其提交给&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;彭博绿色文档&lt;/strong&gt;电影竞赛的机会。大奖：25,000 美元。提交内容截止日期为 2026 年 10 月 2 日。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;请参阅&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/bx9cT2YUy4NO7-rSJJ1MmjLtjRKG7ku9pGN8oZnc7RDOVt5EGB7Pf4VsGYwhTfPTQgIvBwndgsT7IxjhUrswcqpdDSP05GrdMIMmFXj_WPwS-xX9q1KMs5xzaM_XcEkdr2DhznhjydXOLTPK22MH5MQN41CcXtd3bMf3JHwLBVx2Aku5UirFXIyvY779n3d8_e0xPrBrnD_PoynahO9xAudovL0sN2w3_eYNdeiuqxzCWm7PkS1G6OfhgLp6saHi47zYm5V3eKsalxZddFqngqPHZIeoXHlK7CM7jDCfb1pdHXsMcHalxOTnqBEQOJpsAV-ysPmm0iJxijAXOz6DzkOQc3y7fDp7RmKoXE3kfvyItAucu_E0KIUyeeBORS8ysH06_7eOREl9GlVkHMBHU3AL_05rLi_wLUXBF