g.com/a/sc/4BLiNNApS_amt6akskH8k0HAEJeZGvBLo1v8tgrn1j-2tiJjmWv8eweYwV0O4KxGz94s9zyBJBmgrsV7gsEuMSKvuJNYLbNmkayuqmXCYEgUb6HheFrGBewQVrdCUJZ6MHuvKDa3UAFqIr3CoGS5RydWzPVf-E69MofqvQJatsonGz3PESnll9el7pZ9d1x2BGAP5o9bRPihfElk5IQLY5i0t7SWXUISqXgnNF37tgaT01fM0io8GC5gbQ9TtMTtNwGD7UP0TDTk5BWdgK26GHlwtdVEbNNlsh8UEEM91oGMUNUXu14bwX7pmZwJUU2TUhz9QQt_FUaSPMiX5bujFU1bLsxPY7PJC8gIDK0bi1U5IQUOOgV_t03gxsH3hnyU8UoEmRa2JAq_V_RKmnogPffgmrwXvX5N0ZNEcnuPulaMtbxz4Rw1M0vnZZsipDAgYl0yIBrpgUtbb9-r7plHojCNBjbwan7EcDZu-I1B1a0C2KnXeRpGl7oW7MrO_QOZzcd4kqA9m-rJi1_8OSCU1IFy8y9h4uUDn7eiwarkpg/DFkcl6P5lbhahHBYFyAdXlbp6Xidff9j/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="世界大多对贝森特的伊朗制裁警告不屑一顾"&gt;感到无动于衷&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;特朗普直接控制委内瑞拉石油储备的计划&lt;/strong&gt;引发了警告，称这个拉丁美洲国家将成为&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/S3c4-vhO56uUl2_II1PCHlTqV9FXOiwcdZ6kF6z6BkuLZujU5fs2X2kcjN9OBqheILC8nidOBgYjL1RdZZ3E-RQlN21EDvAkF7mFGjPX2Gr6i92mELX4FtMCqwjyzZdPciYRwVgHzgNkA1LJXPO-UrtHuh0J7ue7i9MTus8r5o5hJaaVtLn54dE4vtb0tGWNxs14yJBQJYoIEb9vL_gD74oFmFfrtwl2MbR_l-E9QuQaPczVhDRGDJyCF7Q8RCeRG5wjJY3qQel3es7pgYxSIMSf-0JlBMuosPtxkFU7QCe2WVohBeU-E3q6qOvG4U6nISdCof9gzuiomlnhlqFAZmlns9FD82-W9JeidsH90JBrKTnTNTQmIdUFLOgcryTiRqITG8nOfCLmB4GEUaBKFPy8KJwt9gBdtNvX91NeiAeKCrjWHa4uDqGNdx_m4R2fzZaO5MNAv1UIYKvU3u3OiTxiSopgNh-tviK837Rll0Irec4TycBjClQFKIsNE1kmZEqqMZurGPUH6C7uASVblNvaRpwp6rkdO4EAlfLfzNCM/hQ4AcGbT1aJd40u-O67XFNrEgmZSH_09/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="特朗普对委内瑞拉石油的掠夺重演了工业界的新殖民主义过去"&gt;一个现代资源殖民地，&lt;/a&gt;就像一个世纪前所谓的香蕉共和国一样。 “如果我现在是委内瑞拉的投资者，我会问自己，未来是否会有政府拒绝履行这些合同，”丹佛大学经济学家兼教授弗朗西斯科·罗德里格斯说。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/Cz7g6DE4UF0f-Jda5OA8oFNlxCpO5Vv8E-xFjSNq96_kRKZK93t1op5unv-lPTJ9WElokjN_oObpzbn3TpKc3xjyaC-XqdQMYReQnCMWuwTxnLlu8u3GVnUlcwgRRSgjrELIAia2qYxky